  {
    "KEY": "BARTER_WINDOW_DESC",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/gui/barter_window_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "#weak [BarterMission.GetArmy.GetOwner.GetShortUINamePossessive|U] [barter|E] [army|E] trades [Province.GetBarterGoodsNeeded|0V] [barter_goods|E] for [Province.GetLoot|0V] [loot|E] in [Province.GetName]. [Province.GetNameNoTooltip] will gain [StaticModifier.GetNameWithTooltip] for 5 years.#!",
    "RUS": "#weak [Concept('barter', 'Торговая ')|E] [Concept('army', 'армия')|E] [Select_CString(BarterMission.GetArmy.GetOwner.IsLocalPlayer, 'вашего персонажа', Concatenate('персонажа ',BarterMission.GetArmy.GetOwner.GetShortUIName))] обменивает [Province.GetBarterGoodsNeeded|0V] ед. [Concept('barter_goods', 'меновых товаров')|E] на [Province.GetLoot|0V] ед. [Concept('loot', 'добычи')|E] в провинции [Province.GetName]. [Province.GetNameNoTooltip] получит модификатор «[StaticModifier.GetNameWithTooltip]» на 5 лет.#!",
    "POL": "#weak Prowadząca [Concept('barter', 'wymianę handlową')|E] [army|El], na czele której stoi [BarterMission.GetArmy.GetOwner.GetShortUINameNotMe], przekazuje [barter_goods|El] ([Province.GetBarterGoodsNeeded|0V]) w zamian za [loot|El] ([Province.GetLoot|0V]) w miejscu o nazwie [Province.GetName]. [Province.GetNameNoTooltip] zyska modyfikator „[StaticModifier.GetNameWithTooltip]” na 5 lat.#!",
    "BEL": ""
  }
